<法規性質>法律</法規性質>
<英文法規名稱>1968 Patriot Bond Issuance Act</英文法規名稱>
<中文法規名稱>中華民國五十七年度愛國公債發行條例</中文法規名稱>
<法規網址>https://law.moj.gov.tw/Eng/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=G0360012</法規網址>
<最新英文異動日期>19670609</最新英文異動日期>
<廢止註記>
</廢止註記>
<附件 />
<沿革內容><![CDATA[1.Full text of 12 articles enacted and promulgated by the President on June 9, 1967.]]></沿革內容>
<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Issuance of the 1968 Patriot Bond (hereinafter referred to as the Bond) shall be conducted in compliance with the provisions of this Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The issuance amount of the Bond is set at NT$600 million, and it shall be issued at full face value in the fiscal year 1968. The issue date shall be prescribed by the Executive Yuan.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The certificates of the Bond shall have five face value denominations: NT$500, NT$1,000, NT$5,000, NT$10,000, and NT$50,000. All certificates shall be in bearer form.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The interest rate of the Bond is 4 percent per annum.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The term for redemption of the Bond shall be twelve years. In the first two years, there shall be only interest payments once every six months from the issue date, and in the subsequent ten years, principal and interest payments shall be made in equal installments once every six months, until the Bond has been redeemed in full in twenty installments.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 6</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[If a certificate of the Bond is lost, stolen, or destroyed, the payment cannot be stopped for such reasons, nor shall Paragraph 1 (proviso), Article 720; Article 725 and Article 727 of the Civil Code apply.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 7</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Funds for redemption and interest payments of the Bond shall be included in the national general budget on an annual basis, and shall be appropriated to the managing bank in advance to be held on deposit in preparation of payment.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 8</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The offering and sale, redemption and interest payments of the Bond shall be managed by the Central Bank.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 9</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Bond may be freely traded, pledged, or used as guarantee in official dealings, and may serve as guarantee reserve of financial enterprises.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 10</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Interest on the Bond is exempt from income tax.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 11</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Regulations governing the offering of the Bond shall be separately prescribed.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 12</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[This Act shall come into force from the date of promulgation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
